{
  "id": "collector-dashboard-github",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Collector multi-MCP dashboard + GitHub publish: discover DBs/metadata -> list clusters & VMs -> drill into a cluster, its hosts and a VM -> pull unit-scaled perf + capacity chart specs -> render donut/line images via AntV -> persist URLs to disk (filesystem) -> echo milestones and total storage (everything) -> build a cluster->host->vm knowledge graph (memory) -> create a GitHub repo, seed it, branch, commit the chart URLs + knowledge graph + a report, open a PR and squash-merge it (github). 61 nodes across 8 layers, all 19 collector tools + 8 github tools, cross-node $refs, serialized commits, and breakpoints.",
