        "owner": { "$ref": { "nodeId": "gh_create_repo", "path": "$.structuredContent.owner.login" } },
        "repo": { "$ref": { "nodeId": "gh_create_repo", "path": "$.structuredContent.name" } },
        "branch": "feature/collector-dashboard",
        "from_branch": { "$ref": { "nodeId": "gh_create_repo", "path": "$.structuredContent.default_branch" } }
      },
      "dependsOn": ["gh_seed_main"],
      "breakpoint": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gh_commit_dashboard_md",
      "tool": "github__create_or_update_file",
      "args": {
        "owner": { "$ref": { "nodeId": "gh_create_repo", "path": "$.structuredContent.owner.login" } },
        "repo": { "$ref": { "nodeId": "gh_create_repo", "path": "$.structuredContent.name" } },
        "path": "DASHBOARD.md",
        "content": "# Nutanix Collector Dashboard\n\nProduced end-to-end by an MCP Playground workflow wiring six MCP servers:\n\n1. collector - reads collected Prism SQLite data over a REST API.\n2. chart (AntV) - renders unit-scaled line and donut charts, returning image URLs.\n3. filesystem - persists the chart URLs locally.\n4. everything - echoes milestones and sums the cluster's used + free storage.\n5. memory - builds a cluster -> host -> vm knowledge graph.\n6. github - creates this repo, commits the artifacts, and opens this pull request.\n\n## Contents\n\n- `charts/*.url.txt` - one AntV image URL per chart (open in a browser to view):\n  - `cluster-line.url.txt` - cluster performance over time (%)\n  - `cluster-storage-pie.url.txt` - cluster storage used vs free\n  - `cluster-memory-pie.url.txt` - cluster memory used vs free\n  - `host-line.url.txt` - host performance over time (%)\n  - `host-storage-pie.url.txt` - host storage used vs free\n  - `vm-line.url.txt` - VM performance over time (%)\n  - `clusters-storage-pie.url.txt` - storage across all clusters\n  - `containers-consumed-pie.url.txt` - storage container consumption\n- `knowledge-graph.json` - the cluster/host/vm knowledge graph, with the chart URLs attached as observations.\n\n> Charts are hosted image URLs (not committed images), so they are stored as `.url.txt` files rather than embedded inline.\n",
        "message": "Add collector dashboard report",
        "branch": "feature/collector-dashboard"
      },
      "dependsOn": ["gh_branch"],
      "breakpoint": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gh_commit_cluster_line",
      "tool": "github__create_or_update_file",
